 , Wi Gareth has worked on all sides of both TV and film. Gareth has written
  or appeared on New Girl\, Arrested Development\, I’m Sorry\, Hoops\, Fla
 ked\, You’re The Worst\, A Very Harold and Kumar Xmas\, and Maron.\n\nHe 
 has also appeared on MTV\, Comedy central\, The Travel Channel\, and Netfli
 x. His debut stand up album Riddled With Disease hit #1 on the Billboard co
 medy charts.\n\nHis first special titled ‘England\, Weed\, and the Rest
 ’ is now available on YouTube. He is the father to a cat named Jose.\n\nA
